{"parse": {"title": "FP-05", "pageid": 64907, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/FP-04\" title=\"FP-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">FP-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/FP-06\" title=\"FP-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">FP</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.89.8D.E6.9C.9F.E5.87.86.E5.A4.87\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"前期准备\">前期准备</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 前期准备</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Plans to Scram</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>万<span class=\"color-value\"></span>无<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>失<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>他<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>目<span class=\"color-value\"></span>标<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>但<span class=\"color-value\"></span>这<span class=\"color-value\"></span>也<span class=\"color-value\"></span>仅<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>目<span class=\"color-value\"></span>标<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 191605</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一块布。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>普通的、素净的、平整的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑追随者Ⅰ：</div><div>……这玩意裹在身上，真的不会掉下来吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>追随者们试图将布料摆弄成长袍的样子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>显然，空间想象力并不是他们的长处。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_zhou\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/Cg-1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_zhou.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/Cg-1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_zhou.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/Cg-1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>噢！不行，这样是围不成长袍的——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>而且，他们服装的特征是披挂、垂褶和缠绕，不仅仅是围着一块白布。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>艺术家的审美发挥了作用，他们现在穿得像一个数字了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑追随者Ⅱ：</div><div>真累赘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>追随者们抱怨着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>所以……我们要接受真理的规训，达成灵魂……嗯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>天哪，我从来没想过英语竟然是这样困难的一门语言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑追随者Ⅰ：</div><div>你说得很好，但还是漏了一句——避免我们的灵魂趋于过度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑追随者Ⅱ：</div><div>让灵魂……别过、度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑追随者Ⅱ：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她磕磕巴巴地念出了那个句子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑追随者Ⅱ：</div><div>避免我们、的、灵魂……趋、趋于过度……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306403.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-306403.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306403.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306403.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-306403.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-306403.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>好极了，再说一次呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不善言辞的追随者深深地吸了一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑追随者Ⅱ：</div><div>避免我们的灵魂、趋于过度……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306403.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-306403.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306403.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306403.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-306403.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-306403.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>很好，那么下一项是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>看到清单上的内容，艺术家皱起了眉头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306403.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-306403.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306403.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306403.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-306403.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-306403.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>……学习数学？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306403.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-306403.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306403.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306403.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-306403.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-306403.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>——这是谁写上去的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑追随者Ⅰ：</div><div>故事里的卧底常常因为一些细小的疏忽而暴露行踪……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑追随者Ⅰ：</div><div>虽然很令人痛苦，但不得不承认，数学的学习是有必要的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306403.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-306403.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306403.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306403.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-306403.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-306403.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306403.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-306403.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306403.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306403.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-306403.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-306403.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>我敬佩你的勇气。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhitingnei2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhitingnei2\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhitingnei2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/Cg-1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhitingnei2.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhitingnei2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/Cg-1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhitingnei2.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhitingnei2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/Cg-1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhitingnei2.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhitingnei2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>——我敬佩你的勇气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>向无理数解释数理之美，这本身就是一件很困难的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>尤其还在这种情况下，“流溢”即将到来——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>你不应在这些琐碎的地方消耗精力了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>蓝发的少女转过脸庞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>噢，他们并非不懂数学，只是还没有从现象世界的琐屑中脱身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>就像黄金螺旋线。那个艺术家不知道它的公式和本质，但这并不影响他们使用它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我相信，他确实从课程中学到了什么——希望这能让他更加地接近真理！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无数的海鸥掠过海岸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑追随者Ⅰ：</div><div>我们也要像那个领袖一样，在这里踱步吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑追随者Ⅰ：</div><div>能告诉我，这有什么意义吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>噢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他有些失落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>我以为你们会喜欢这片黄昏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑追随者Ⅰ：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑追随者Ⅰ：</div><div>见鬼，我总觉得我和你之间需要一名翻译。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他转头望向另一位不知所措的同伴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑追随者Ⅰ：</div><div>你听懂他在说什么了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑追随者Ⅱ：</div><div>别忘记……他是、艺术家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑追随者Ⅱ：</div><div>不过、这条路……很熟悉——我来过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>是的，每个人都应该来这里看看夕阳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑追随者Ⅱ：</div><div>不……我有一个……更重要的、任务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-503101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑追随者Ⅰ：</div><div>任务？你收到了上面的指示？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑追随者Ⅱ：</div><div>……只是、我自己的决、决定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她指向沙滩的一侧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑追随者Ⅱ：</div><div>我在那、那里埋了一颗……炸弹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>……炸弹？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑追随者Ⅱ：</div><div>因为……那里是、是领袖一定……会走过的、地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑追随者Ⅱ：</div><div>杀了、领袖……就能从、从根源上……解决问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑追随者Ⅱ：</div><div>不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>哦……不！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>你还能找到那颗炸弹吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>剑拔弩张的氛围之下，任何矛盾都有可能成为战争的导火索。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑追随者Ⅱ：</div><div>哦……那会是一个大、大工程……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抬手指向沙地，所有的沙子都别无二致。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-517301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑追随者Ⅱ：</div><div>……它就在这片沙、地之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他蹲下了身，开始从沙地之中寻找引爆器。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不多时，一片阴影从身后笼罩了他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306415.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-306415.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306415.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306415.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-306415.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306415.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-306415.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306415.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>找到了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……你们在找这个吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>除错师的手中，拿着一团混杂了各色电线、传感器以及起爆器的装置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>呃，是的，谢谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>这是很危险的装置，给我吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>你让我把凶器重新放回凶手的掌心吗？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "FP-05"}}